          "name": "get_my_claims_flow",
          "description": "List the verified customer's claims on all their Copperleaf policies: claim_no (e.g. CLM-2026-0051), policy, claim type, incident and filed dates, estimated amount, deductible, claim_status (Submitted, Under review, Approved, Settled, Denied) with status_text, approved and paid amounts with the payment reference, and the related review request (case_id, case_status and the customer_message once decided).",
          "schemas": {
