        "name": "verify_policyholder_flow",
        "description": "Verify a Copperleaf policyholder with their policy number (CAI-100101, cai100101, CAI 100101 or 100101 all work) and the one-time code texted to them. Returns VERIFIED with a session_token (valid 60 minutes), their first name, the verified policy number, product tier and today&#39;s date (YYYY-MM-DD), or VERIFY_FAILED, or LOCKED after too many failed attempts. Call this before any customer tool. Never reveal, guess or hint at codes. Staff use verify_reviewer instead. Quote any reason_text to the person as written; never change an outcome.",
