    {
      "id": "flow:search_policy_wording_flow",
      "data": {
        "name": "search_policy_wording_flow",
        "description": "Search Copperleaf&#39;s policy wording documents (Full Coverage wording, Liability &amp; Comprehensive wording, Endorsements &amp; Add-ons, Claims Procedure Guide) for what the policy says: what is covered or excluded, definitions, conditions, deductibles rules, the claims-free discount and how to make a claim. Write a short natural-language query and include the customer&#39;s product tier in the query (e.g. &#39;Full Coverage: is flood damage from driving into standing water covered?&#39;). Returns the most relevant passages with document names and scores. Use the passages to answer and name the document; never invent wording, and never use it for the customer&#39;s own numbers or status (use the get_my_* tools for facts).",
        "links": [
          {
            "id": 1,
            "from": "StartActivity",
            "to": "ReadOutcome",
            "type": "label",
            "label": "StartActivity to ReadOutcome"
